{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">SOLO OR MULTIPLAYER</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play <strong>alone or with friends</strong> </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Up to 4 players in <strong>Co-op PvE</strong> or <strong>PvP</strong> </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A daily <strong>World Boss</strong> with a global ranking </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A very challenging <strong>Draft Mode</strong> </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dozens of different skills </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A multiplayer market to sell your loot </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">EVERY CHARACTER IS UNIQUE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can't copy another's build; you must choose between random skill combinations, and each character has different options!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Customize each skill with unique and random mods to try to create the best possible combination!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">BECOME STRONGER WITH EVERY RUN</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Replay endlessly with ever stronger abilities, items, and enemies! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">RAISE PETS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can find and raise pets that will help you in battle! The higher their level and tier, the stronger they will be </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">They will inherit their parents' skills and discover new ones. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">IT'S A COMPETITIVE GAME</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Everything is designed to push you to give your best, even when playing solo! All game modes have global rankings!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3565670?t=1751101373","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3565670?t=1751101373","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565670/810f7041f2155473bc2184dfa377a85acbce59b1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751101373","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565670/810f7041f2155473bc2184dfa377a85acbce59b1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1751101373","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer","id":27},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"In-App Purchases","id":35},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">SOLO OR MULTIPLAYER</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play <strong>alone or with friends</strong> </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Up to 4 players in <strong>Co-op PvE</strong> or <strong>PvP</strong> </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A daily <strong>World Boss</strong> with a global ranking </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A very challenging <strong>Draft Mode</strong> </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dozens of different skills </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A multiplayer market to sell your loot </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">EVERY CHARACTER IS UNIQUE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can't copy another's build; you must choose between random skill combinations, and each character has different options!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Customize each skill with unique and random mods to try to create the best possible combination!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">BECOME STRONGER WITH EVERY RUN</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Replay endlessly with ever stronger abilities, items, and enemies! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">RAISE PETS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can find and raise pets that will help you in battle! The higher their level and tier, the stronger they will be </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">They will inherit their parents' skills and discover new ones. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">IT'S A COMPETITIVE GAME</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Everything is designed to push you to give your best, even when playing solo! All game modes have global rankings!</p>","developers":["Hypno Games"],"ext_user_account_notice":"Free Cross-Platform account ","genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565670/4d74e5c1fc6612ad4a60e7f0911bb184e1197a83/header.jpg?t=1751101373","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257162643,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257162643/movie480.mp4?t=1751101370","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257162643/movie_max.mp4?t=1751101370"},"name":"Mythic Trials 2 - Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257162643/f63971bbe231dcc214bfb6efc08c7111c4a3abe0/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1751101370","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257162643/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1751101370","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257162643/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1751101370"}}],"name":"Mythic Trials 2","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and